  "description": "UNLIMITED EP801 | 85 NM\n\nPowerful, lightweight, and intelligent it significantly improves assistance with more efficient energy management, offering a more natural riding experience.\n\nThe high-performance Shimano EP801 motor generates a maximum torque of 85 Nm and provides a wide cadence range. This ensures smooth and natural riding even on technical terrain or steep slopes, providing effective assistance even at low cadences.\n\nCUSTOMIZABLE DISPLAY\n\nWith the Shimano E-Tube app, you can customize the assistance modes according to your preferences and needs.\n\nThe iLynx+SL comes with two preloaded profiles; Full Power for maximum power, and Endurance, for maximizing range to extend your ride as long as possible. These profiles can be customized to suit your needs, giving you the freedom to adapt your e-bike to your riding style and route type.\n\nMAXIMUM AUTONOMY | 810WH\n\nAll models come standard with a 630Wh battery housed in the down tube, weighing 2.6 kilograms, composed of 21700 cells with 5.8Ah, offering maximum energy density per weight and allowing more energy to be stored in a smaller space.\n\nThe additional XPro DD external battery is optionally available and provides an extra 180 Wh.\n\n100% POWER AT ALL TIMES\n\nThe iLynx+SL guarantees 100% motor power at all times, regardless of whether you use only the internal battery or both the internal and XPro DD batteries together.\n\nREMOTE CONTROL & DISPLAY SHIMANO\n\nThe system is managed by the minimalist EN600L remote control in combination with the Shimano EN600 display. Thanks to this combination, it is possible to know all the driving data and switch between Full Power and Endurance profiles on the go.\n\nLYNX IDENTITY\n\nSPLIT PIVOT TECHNOLOGY | The Split Pivot suspension system, maintains more than 100% of Antisquat - ensuring pedaling efficiency - and Brake Squat - ensuring optimal braking.\n\nON ANY TERRAIN | With a 140mm suspension travel, the iLynx+SL is ideal for those seeking a versatile bike that can effectively tackle a variety of trails. The 160mm travel range is specifically designed for Enduro enthusiasts. This setup is perfect for tackling technical and demanding descents with confidence and control.",
